# The Play view in the other two board views (Blueprint, Deep space; Atlas is in play-view.ui): the 6-timeline position with a queen of L-2 lifted, so
# a card's chip, the history stacks, the dots, the arc and the inspector (the jump targets on past boards) are all on screen.
# Settings -> Display -> "Board view" cycles Atlas, Blueprint, Deep space (200,244); Back (125,25). The main menu's Settings is (150,490).
wait 20
click 150 490        # Settings
wait 30
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
click 200 244        # Blueprint
wait 10
click 125 25
wait 30
startplayview on
record ../records/play-view-6tl.5dr
wait 90
clicksq -2 8 d1
wait 30
hoversq -1 8 c2
wait 30
capture play-view-blueprint
click 125 25        # Back to the mode list ...
wait 30
click 700 712        # ... and to the main menu
wait 30
click 150 490
wait 30
click 880 172
wait 20
click 200 244        # Deep space
wait 10
click 125 25
wait 30
record ../records/play-view-6tl.5dr
wait 90
clicksq -2 8 d1
wait 30
hoversq -1 8 c2
wait 30
capture play-view-deep-space
